      "text": "[ PASSOFF- 114 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(Sunday Afternoon)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "Our family often visits the house of my father’s friend."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "We sometimes visit our relatives or they come to our house."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I like visiting my relatives on Sunday afternoons."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "It’s nice to see how they are doing."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I also like to visit the house of my father’s friend because"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "his children are the same age and we always have great fun"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "spending our time together."
    },
